    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/ea8db6ab6fb072fd3069ac8d2cdf035b.poster.avif?t=1755441929\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/ea8db6ab6fb072fd3069ac8d2cdf035b.webm?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/ea8db6ab6fb072fd3069ac8d2cdf035b.mp4?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IN THE FACADE WE TRUST\u2122</strong> traps you in a corridor caught in an ever-changing and increasingly unsettling loop. With each cycle, you\u2019ll notice subtle differences, but more importantly, you\u2019ll feel yourself progressing through the story. However, your objective in this corridor is not just to observe the changes,\u00a0it's a game of trust. As the narrative unfolds, you will be forced to place your trust in someone during each cycle. The girl, who is obsessive with you, and the creature that isn\u2019t what it seems will try to convince you that they are thinking of your well-being. The catch? Who you choose to trust will depend on both the knowledge you\u2019ve gained from previous cycles and the unfolding events in the current one.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/e7b93fe1ff2c776b2271dd72c027c7c6.poster.avif?t=1755441929\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/e7b93fe1ff2c776b2271dd72c027c7c6.webm?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/e7b93fe1ff2c776b2271dd72c027c7c6.mp4?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/14a198f5389596e523392cb42d01a9fe.poster.avif?t=1755441929\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/14a198f5389596e523392cb42d01a9fe.webm?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/14a198f5389596e523392cb42d01a9fe.mp4?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this spine-tingling narrative, you will encounter two intriguing figures. The girl, who is obsessed with you, appears helpful yet enigmatic. Her presence is both comforting and unsettling, as she desperately seeks your trust while not wanting you to discover her own secrets. You will find yourself drawn to her, but also feeling uneasy about her true intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the other hand, the creature embodies an unknown truth. It seems terrifying and unpredictable. Although it appears threatening, there is an unsettling charm that beckons you to uncover the reality behind its existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both characters will challenge your perceptions, choices, and trust with their words. But be cautious. The one you do not choose may complicate your next cycle, making it more difficult, tense, and terrifying. It can confuse you and will do everything in its power to undermine your trust in the one you chose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/aa6e04bdaf025820271372ba50020930.poster.avif?t=1755441929\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/aa6e04bdaf025820271372ba50020930.webm?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/aa6e04bdaf025820271372ba50020930.mp4?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photorealistic graphics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No randomized events, a carefully planned narrative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pop-ups constantly telling you whether your choices are right or wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two distinct paths leading to two different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IN THE FACADE WE TRUST\u2122 is a short (~75 minutes) psychological horror walking simulator inspired by genre pioneers like <i>P.T.</i>. It offers a trust-based experience where the structure remains constant, but the details evolve to tell a compelling story.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/ea8db6ab6fb072fd3069ac8d2cdf035b.poster.avif?t=1755441929\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/ea8db6ab6fb072fd3069ac8d2cdf035b.webm?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/ea8db6ab6fb072fd3069ac8d2cdf035b.mp4?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IN THE FACADE WE TRUST\u2122</strong> traps you in a corridor caught in an ever-changing and increasingly unsettling loop. With each cycle, you\u2019ll notice subtle differences, but more importantly, you\u2019ll feel yourself progressing through the story. However, your objective in this corridor is not just to observe the changes,\u00a0it's a game of trust. As the narrative unfolds, you will be forced to place your trust in someone during each cycle. The girl, who is obsessive with you, and the creature that isn\u2019t what it seems will try to convince you that they are thinking of your well-being. The catch? Who you choose to trust will depend on both the knowledge you\u2019ve gained from previous cycles and the unfolding events in the current one.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/e7b93fe1ff2c776b2271dd72c027c7c6.poster.avif?t=1755441929\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/e7b93fe1ff2c776b2271dd72c027c7c6.webm?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/e7b93fe1ff2c776b2271dd72c027c7c6.mp4?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/14a198f5389596e523392cb42d01a9fe.poster.avif?t=1755441929\" width=800 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/14a198f5389596e523392cb42d01a9fe.webm?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/14a198f5389596e523392cb42d01a9fe.mp4?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this spine-tingling narrative, you will encounter two intriguing figures. The girl, who is obsessed with you, appears helpful yet enigmatic. Her presence is both comforting and unsettling, as she desperately seeks your trust while not wanting you to discover her own secrets. You will find yourself drawn to her, but also feeling uneasy about her true intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the other hand, the creature embodies an unknown truth. It seems terrifying and unpredictable. Although it appears threatening, there is an unsettling charm that beckons you to uncover the reality behind its existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both characters will challenge your perceptions, choices, and trust with their words. But be cautious. The one you do not choose may complicate your next cycle, making it more difficult, tense, and terrifying. It can confuse you and will do everything in its power to undermine your trust in the one you chose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/aa6e04bdaf025820271372ba50020930.poster.avif?t=1755441929\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/aa6e04bdaf025820271372ba50020930.webm?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264050/extras/aa6e04bdaf025820271372ba50020930.mp4?t=1755441929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photorealistic graphics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No randomized events, a carefully planned narrative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pop-ups constantly telling you whether your choices are right or wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two distinct paths leading to two different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IN THE FACADE WE TRUST\u2122 is a short (~75 minutes) psychological horror walking simulator inspired by genre pioneers like <i>P.T.</i>. It offers a trust-based experience where the structure remains constant, but the details evolve to tell a compelling story.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019re torn between a girl who is obsessed with you and a creature. Whose words can lead you out of this endless and dangerous loop? Which you are you? Who is the real monster? Trust the right person in the right cycle to get closer to the exit, or be misled by facades, complicating your next loop.",
